      <div class="company-intro"><p class="eyebrow">About Bella Vista</p><h2 id="about-title">A little escape.<br>A place to <em>gather.</em></h2><p class="company-lead">Bella Vista Dining is a premier farm-to-table restaurant offering a cozy, ambient, and modern dining experience.</p><p>It serves a fusion of local Filipino comfort food and continental specialties, designed for families, couples, and groups seeking a delightful culinary escape.</p><div class="company-links"><a class="text-link" href="/reserve#menu">Explore the menu <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/#history">Read our history <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div>
