    <section class="company-history section intro-history" id="history" aria-labelledby="history-title" tabindex="-1"><div class="wrap history-layout">
      <div class="history-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Our story</p><h2 id="history-title">A beginning worth<br><em>sharing.</em></h2><figure class="history-scene"><img src="/assets/images/intro/garden-estate-concept-small.webp" alt="Garden-estate restaurant concept with brick arches and warm evening lights" width="960" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption><span class="history-year">2021</span><span>Established alongside<br>the Bella Vista estate</span></figcaption></figure></div>
      <div class="history-copy"><ol class="story-timeline"><li><h3>The estate beginnings</h3><p class="company-lead">Established alongside the Bella Vista estate in 2021, the dining hall initially catered exclusively to in-house guests.</p></li><li><h3>A place of our own</h3><p>Due to overwhelming public demand for its signature dishes and scenic garden views, it expanded into an independent destination restaurant known for its exquisite food, ambient atmosphere, and exceptional customer service.</p></li></ol><p class="company-source">Company profile and history supplied in the restaurant brief for this academic project. The exterior above is an original concept visual.</p><a class="button ghost" href="/reserve">Find your table <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="story-photo-credits"><summary>About these images</summary><p>All restaurant views are original AI-generated concept images for this academic project, not actual venue photographs or archival images from 2021.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>
